    tmk:authoringReasoning "Part 32A lists the forms the plant industry treats as synonyms of a variety name; the withdrawn duplicate GC-0125 was labelled with one of them (ruling A1). 'cultivar' and bare 'variety' are left out: the first is a botanical term with its own sense, the second too general to recognise."@en-AU ;
    tmk:confidence 8.5e-01 ;
