tmka:GR-0088 a tmk:AuthoredAssertion ;
    rdfs:comment "Re-judged on 2026-10-08 by S026 under the owner's ruling D1 (review/rulings/2026-10-08-chat-ontology-review.yaml): the ground was the subject and the threshold the object, the inversion the predicate's definition forbids. The evidence is the original author's. Re-pointed on 2026-10-09 by S027: object GC-0006 -> GC-0181 — ground-for-rejection edges whose sentence is about section 41 point at that section's ground (ruling B4). The judgement and evidence are the original author's."@en-AU ;
