    tmk:spanEnd 1323 ;
    tmk:spanStart 1140 ;
    tmk:supportingText "The trade marks have some inherent adaptation to distinguish but they are not prima facie capable of distinguishing. In this instance a section 41 ground for rejection is appropriate." ;
    tmk:tier 3 .

