    tmk:authoringReasoning "The Manual's summary attributed to Metro assesses likely confusion by reference to the ordinary person's reasonable doubt about common source. The consumer perspective qualifies the assessment; reasonable doubt, rather than the consumer concept alone, supplies the stated threshold."@en-AU ;
