    tmk:spanEnd 562 ;
    tmk:spanStart 343 ;
    tmk:supportingText "Geographical names with more than one meaning may have some inherent adaptation to distinguish if there is some ambiguity as to whether or not other traders would desire to use the trade mark for its geographic meaning." ;
    tmk:tier 3 .

