    tmk:authoringBasis "corpus_inferred" ;
    tmk:authoringReasoning "The sentence establishes that if the presence of the stem is not meaningful, it will not lead to deception or confusion. This logically implies that deception or confusion requires a meaningful inclusion of the stem."@en-AU ;
    tmk:expertShouldCheck "Whether the second model's reading is right where the first model's was judged wrong; both read the same sentence."@en-AU ;
