    tmk:spanEnd 1439 ;
    tmk:spanStart 1224 ;
    tmk:supportingText "However, the examiner needs to consider how the variety name appears within the trade mark as a whole. For example, if the plant name is a dictionary word appearing in a phrase then connotation may not be immediate." ;
