    tmk:spanEnd 416 ;
    tmk:spanStart 0 ;
    tmk:supportingText "There is a mandatory provision (section 84B) relating to revocation of registration within one month of a component of a notice of opposition being filed, or an application for extension of time to file a notice being made, if the Registrar has inadvertently registered a trade mark in the face of a properly filed component of a notice of opposition to registration, or an application for extension of time to file." ;
    tmk:tier 3 .

