tmka:GR-0240 a tmk:AuthoredAssertion ;
    rdfs:comment "Re-read on 2026-10-09 from a second model's audit (gemini-3.1-pro-preview, audit-v1): was GC-0079 extendsTo GC-0074. Re-read on 2026-10-09 in the structure review (ADR-0131): was GC-0079 related GC-0074."@en-AU ;
