    rdfs:comment "Re-pointed on 2026-10-08 by S026: subject GC-0110 -> GC-0043 — an authored duplicate withdrawn in favour of the signed concept (ruling A1, ADR-0080 c2). The judgement and evidence are the original author's. Re-read on 2026-10-09 from a second model's audit (gemini-3.1-pro-preview, audit-v1): was GC-0043 appliesTo GC-0079. Re-read on 2026-10-09 in the structure review (ADR-0131): was GC-0043 related GC-0079."@en-AU ;
