tmka:GR-0418 a tmk:AuthoredAssertion ;
    rdfs:comment "Re-pointed on 2026-10-08 by S026: object GC-0006 -> GC-0168 — ground-for-rejection edges sorted between the general concept GC-0006 and the section 43 ground GC-0168 by whether the sentence is about section 43 (ruling A2). The judgement and evidence are the original author's."@en-AU ;
    tmk:assertionObject tmkc:GC-0168 ;
