    tmk:authoringReasoning "Section 206(2): a delegate may be required to act under the direction or supervision of the Registrar or of a person named in the instrument — the statutory hook for supervision within the office."@en-AU ;
    tmk:confidence 9e-01 ;
    tmk:expertShouldCheck "The duty applies only 'if so required by the instrument of delegation'; whether any current instrument requires it is not in the corpus."@en-AU ;
