    tmk:spanEnd 560 ;
    tmk:spanStart 297 ;
    tmk:supportingText "A delegate must, if so required by the instrument of delegation, exercise or perform a delegated power or function under the direction or supervision of: (a) the Registrar; or (b) a person specified in the instrument, being a person referred to in subsection (1)." ;
    tmk:tier 3 .

