    tmk:authoringBasis "corpus_explicit" ;
    tmk:authoringReasoning "Section 11 gives 'pending' its meaning only in relation to an application; the label now carries the application with it. Relabelled on the owner's ruling E3."@en-AU ;
    tmk:confidence 9.9e-01 ;
    tmk:definitionSource <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s11> ;
    tmk:expertShouldCheck "Check whether the ontology should represent application statuses as standalone concepts or properties, and whether the historical rule in section 11(2) needs separate treatment."@en-AU ;
