        tmk:LegalConcept ;
    rdfs:comment "Summary, not a definition: Summary: The repealed Act denotes the Trade Marks Act 1955 and its regulations as in force immediately before repeal, with references to particular sections generally including regulations made for those sections."@en-AU ;
