    tmk:definitionSource <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part2/3/2/3/4> ;
    tmk:expertShouldCheck "Check the complete legislative definition and its location: the supplied legislative fragment is labelled r2.1, whereas the Manual identifies r2.2 as the interpretation provision; the fragment does not disclose the statement’s required contents or who must sign it."@en-AU ;
