tmkc:GC-0169 a skos:Concept,
        tmk:LegalConcept,
        tmk:SignContent ;
    rdfs:comment "A geographical indication for wine, entered on the Wine Register under the Wine Australia Act 2013. Different from other geographical indications: wine GIs have a dedicated statutory scheme, while other GIs are principally protected through certification trade marks (owner's ruling A4). The Act itself is not in the corpus; the Manual's account of it is."@en-AU ;
