    tmk:authoringReasoning "Part 32B lists Australian and European geographical indications as categories of term on the Wine Register. The owner ruled that wine GIs are different from other GIs because they have their own statutory scheme, so they are a concept of their own, narrower than GI (GC-0018)."@en-AU ;
