tmkc:GC-0134 a skos:Concept,
        tmk:LegalConcept,
        tmk:ProcessRole ;
    rdfs:comment "Summary, not a definition: Summary: ART is the statutory abbreviation for the Administrative Review Tribunal, a body rather than a category of goods."@en-AU ;
