tmkc:GC-0078 a skos:Concept,
        tmk:LegalConcept,
        tmk:SubjectMatter ;
    rdfs:comment "The Manual identifies graphical representation as the hard problem for scent, which ties this concept to the section 40 ground more tightly than any other sign kind."@en-AU ;
