    tmk:authoringReasoning "Defined in terms by the Manual with the statutory reference attached."@en-AU ;
    tmk:confidence 8.5e-01 ;
    tmk:definitionSource <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part24/1%231> ;
    tmk:expertShouldCheck "Whether a disclaimer is a species of the section 6 'limitations' or a different instrument. The Manual's wording supports the first; the Act's structure the second."@en-AU ;
