tmkc:GC-0142 a skos:Concept,
        tmk:LegalConcept,
        tmk:ProceduralStep ;
    rdfs:comment "Summary, not a definition: Summary: An application for removal initiates a process seeking removal of a trade mark from the Register, described in the supplied Manual passages in the context of non-use."@en-AU ;
    skos:altLabel "application for removal for non-use"@en-AU,
        "non-use application"@en-AU ;
    skos:inScheme tmkc:scheme-s43 ;
    skos:prefLabel "application for removal"@en-AU ;
    tmk:authoredBy "gpt-6.1-sol" ;
    tmk:authoredDate "2026-10-07"^^xsd:date ;
    tmk:authoringBasis "corpus_explicit" ;
    tmk:authoringReasoning "The Regulations expressly define the term. The Manual describes filing the application, opposition to it and rebuttal, supporting a distinct procedural concept rather than a generic phrase. It is provisionally distinguished from GC-0104 removal for non-use because the application initiates the process and is not itself removal. The Manual also expressly distinguishes it from an application for cessation of protection concerning a protected international trade mark."@en-AU ;
    tmk:confidence 8.8e-01 ;
    tmk:definitionSource <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r9.2/application-for-removal> ;
    tmk:expertShouldCheck "Check whether GC-0104 already encompasses the initiating application; the existing concept's label alone does not establish its scope."@en-AU ;
    tmk:goldRecord "GC-0142" ;
    tmk:labelKey "application for removal",
        "application for removal for non use",
        "non use application" ;
    tmk:legislativeBasis <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s100>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s100(3)(c)>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s92> ;
    tmk:notLabel "application for cessation of protection"@en-AU,
        "notice of opposition"@en-AU,
        "removal for non-use"@en-AU ;
    tmk:notLabelKey "application for cessation of protection",
        "notice of opposition",
        "removal for non use" ;
    tmk:origin "authored" ;
    tmk:prefLabelKey "application for removal" ;
    tmk:requiresElement tmkc:GC-0156 ;
    tmk:reviewStatus "unreviewed" ;
    tmk:sourcePassage <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r9.2/application-for-removal> ;
    tmk:typedBy tmka:GT-0142 .

tmkc:GC-0158 a skos:Concept,
        tmk:InstrumentOrRecord,
        tmk:LegalConcept ;
    rdfs:comment "Summary, not a definition: Summary: A notice filed by the relevant applicant or IRDA holder to contest an opposition, with filing requirements and consequences of non-filing that depend on the proceeding."@en-AU ;
    skos:inScheme tmkc:scheme-s43 ;
    skos:prefLabel "notice of intention to defend"@en-AU ;
    tmk:authoredBy "gpt-6.1-sol" ;
    tmk:authoredDate "2026-10-07"^^xsd:date ;
    tmk:authoringBasis "corpus_explicit" ;
    tmk:authoringReasoning "The Regulations expressly define this notice by reference to operative filing provisions. It is a distinct document, not the opposition itself or the notice of opposition already represented in the ontology. The quoted provision supplies the IRDA holder’s filing obligation, address-for-service requirement and provision of a copy to the opponent. Regulation 17A.48Q separately governs a notice filed by the applicant in an opposition concerning cessation of protection. The Manual explains its role in contesting opposition to registration or protection, but that explanation is Registrar practice rather than legislation."@en-AU ;
    tmk:confidence 9.8e-01 ;
    tmk:definitionSource <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.34H> ;
    tmk:expertShouldCheck "Check the domestic registration and non-use provisions, whose operative text is not supplied, before completing the concept’s scope; in regulation 17A.48Q the filing party is the applicant for cessation of protection, not necessarily the trade mark holder."@en-AU ;
    tmk:goldRecord "GC-0158" ;
    tmk:labelKey "notice of intention to defend" ;
    tmk:legislativeBasis <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.29>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.34H>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.34H(2)>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.34H(5)>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.48Q> ;
    tmk:notLabel "notice of intention to oppose"@en-AU,
        "notice of opposition"@en-AU,
        "statement of grounds and particulars"@en-AU ;
    tmk:notLabelKey "notice of intention to oppose",
        "notice of opposition",
        "statement of ground and particular" ;
    tmk:origin "authored" ;
    tmk:prefLabelKey "notice of intention to defend" ;
