    tmk:authoringReasoning "The Regulations expressly name and partially define this document. TMM/Part47/1/1/1 explains that it must be filed to complete the notice of opposition and cites regulation 17A.32. It is a distinct component of GC-0103 notice of opposition, not a duplicate of that concept or of opposition generally. The supplied definition is incomplete, so no claim is made about its required contents. The Manual passage explains practice and cites legislation; it is not itself legislation."@en-AU ;
    tmk:confidence 9.4e-01 ;
    tmk:definitionSource <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.29/statement-of-grounds-and-particulars> ;
    tmk:expertShouldCheck "The supplied legislative definitions stop at the colon, so the required contents cannot be established from these passages; check the complete definitions and the filing requirements in regulation 17A.32."@en-AU ;
    tmk:goldRecord "GC-0153" ;
