    tmk:authoringBasis "corpus_explicit" ;
    tmk:authoringReasoning "Section 44's note names the term and states its effect on examination, which is the operative fact. The Regulations' own definition is a pointer, as with IRDA."@en-AU ;
    tmk:confidence 7e-01 ;
    tmk:definitionSource <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part60/1/1/1> ;
    tmk:expertShouldCheck "The definition source is a Part 60 passage about the Protocol generally rather than about protection specifically."@en-AU ;
