tmkc:GC-0171 a skos:Concept,
        tmk:LegalConcept,
        tmk:ProcessRole ;
    rdfs:comment "An employee to whom the Registrar has delegated powers or functions by signed instrument (s 206). Examiners, senior examiners, examination team leaders and hearing officers are delegates; a delegate's decision is a decision under the Registrar's powers, but the delegate is not the Registrar (owner's rulings C1 and C2)."@en-AU ;
