tmkc:GC-0181 a skos:Concept,
        tmk:GroundOfRefusal,
        tmk:LegalConcept ;
    rdfs:comment "The ground section 41 creates: a trade mark that is not capable of distinguishing the applicant's goods or services. Held apart from the general idea of a ground for rejection (GC-0006) and from the test it turns on (GC-0058, capable of distinguishing), the way the section 43 ground was (GC-0168, ruling A2). Edges whose sentence is about section 41 point here (ruling B4)."@en-AU ;
    skos:altLabel "ground for rejection under s 41"@en-AU,
        "ground for rejection under section 41"@en-AU,
        "grounds for rejection under section 41"@en-AU,
        "objection under s 41"@en-AU,
        "s 41 ground for rejection"@en-AU ;
    skos:broader tmkc:GC-0006 ;
    skos:inScheme tmkc:scheme-s43 ;
    skos:prefLabel "section 41 ground for rejection"@en-AU ;
    tmk:allocatesTo tmkc:GC-0044 ;
    tmk:authoredBy "claude-code-agent-S027" ;
    tmk:authoredDate "2026-10-09"^^xsd:date ;
    tmk:authoringBasis "corpus_explicit" ;
    tmk:authoringReasoning "Section 41 creates one of the closed set of grounds, and the Manual names it 'a section 41 ground for rejection' throughout Parts 22 and 23. Until now the vocabulary held its test (capable of distinguishing) and the general ground, and no concept for the ground itself — sections 39, 40, 42 and 44 each had one (review B4)."@en-AU ;
    tmk:confidence 9e-01 ;
    tmk:definitionSource <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s41>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/1%231> ;
    tmk:expertShouldCheck "Whether the pre-2013 wording of section 41 (subsections (5) and (6), still applied to applications filed before 15 April 2013, Part 12.9) is the same ground or wants a concept of its own."@en-AU ;
    tmk:goldRecord "GC-0181" ;
    tmk:labelKey "ground for rejection under s 41",
        "ground for rejection under section 41",
        "objection under s 41",
        "s 41 ground for rejection",
        "section 41 ground for rejection" ;
    tmk:legislativeBasis <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s41> ;
    tmk:notLabel "capable of distinguishing"@en-AU,
        "section 43 ground for rejection"@en-AU,
        "section 44 ground"@en-AU ;
    tmk:notLabelKey "capable of distinguishing",
